    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not even about \"rediscovering\" things. that’s what everyone says, but they don't get it. the athlete was the person. the version of me that actually mattered. now? i'm just a bystander in my own life. it feels like the story already reached its peak and now i'm just watching the credits roll in slow motion. it's hard to see the point in dragging out the epilogue when the main event is over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
